        "Name": "GRAND \u2014 Injectite distribution and NTG uncertainty",
        "Summary": "Sub-seismic injectites drive uncertainty in net sand and connectivity, impacting well placement and volumes.",
        "Description": "Thin sand sills and dykes below seismic resolution lead to uncertain NTG and connectivity affecting volumetrics.\n\nKey Uncertainty \u2014 Injectite volume contribution [Medium]: Sand remobilisation and injection processes have generated a complex network of sand dykes and sills. Predicting their location and volumetric potential is highly uncertain. Mapped injectites contribute 22.1 MSm\u00b3 (REF) but unmapped injectites add 14.9 MSm\u00b3 with high uncertainty.",
